&_nc_ohc=uwAwmtFlWKQQ7kNvwEMR0ah&_nc_oc=Adlbij5A-hmtHLTUCiRBHkUZwIoCiXPkv07kLgw8jQiC5EBin0R0oVNw8dEPH3mgPDI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afzz7qAaW23Ha8lsBusedbuTrS7H6SOEiQbEhCEP2AH7UA&oe=69B7EFAB"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260306-065440.png", "id": "983076857378860", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823395_983076860712193_8354097057286737736_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=N8v838c4we4Q7kNvwFcaOe7&_nc_oc=AdneqFig7Z3YyPTfF04Fm4BQZ_OGeVrnieDcqBINntkAS2sEzGdkXyb2sdfT7-W25cw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxR6cM-ZmlYKDW2bDyvrP174Ie7wNmKcFDTsfg_vjgGuA&oe=69B7FFDF"}, {"file_name": "com.boxingdrills.vr-20260306-065405.png", "id": "2442422822886145", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618069_2442422826219478_5027518634157268285_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gbp80cKvvWgQ7kNvwFrKU5Y&_nc_oc=AdnjAZqzOZPoxWVgDPofa9g0rPEGLq3EmFIY5H5Ljn9eXSAp0cM-ARbJuwqAHVX-bjg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afx-ex6qEm6gMW_je7fnxnRsw9XjELVQSnUvCGFNrsL85g&oe=69B7FAF2"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "cover_landscape.png", "id": "1595686508155082", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499618472_1595686511488415_510087455054191114_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=V_v83aUZOiwQ7kNvwEtr6m_&_nc_oc=AdnKRgGwQjNLimCITtfPsNS99DKz3DnudM5eXzNAHUZKbNRvekGx0ICx825r9yuvzjw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfxYOJ4mhVnkJcUdMpKNiJgHSEmkF5w3TUu_EyxtWAHoiQ&oe=69B80FD6"}, "display_name": "Boxing Drills VR", "keywords": ["boxing", "padwork", "trainer", "drills", "speed"], "long_description": "# Train Like a Real Boxer\n\nBoxing Drills for authentic pad training to your Quest. No gym required.\n\n**Realistic Drills**\n\nFollow a virtual trainer through classic boxing combinations:\n- **1-2 (Jab-Cross)** - The fundamental combo\n- **1-2-Duck** - Add defensive movement\n- **1-2-3** - Jab, Cross, Hook\n- **1-2-3-2** - Extended combinations\n- **Uppercut combos** - Work those body shots\n- **Growing Library** - A vast selection of drills with new content added regularly!\n\n**Built for Performance**\n\nWe know every millisecond counts when you're in the pocket.\n- Low-Latency Precision: Built from the ground up for high-performance tracking.\n- Native Feel: Optimized to ensure smooth, responsive feedback that feels like hitting real pads.\n\n**Get Scored**\n\nEvery session tracks your performance:\n- **Power** - Hit those pads hard\n- **Speed** - Quick reactions matter\n- **Agility** - Duck and weave like a pro\n- **Form** - Return to guard after every punch\n\n**Train Your Way**\n- Multiple drill durations (30s to 3 min)\n- Choose the speed that suits you (slow, medium, fast, progressive, variable)\n- Passthrough mode - train safely in your own space\n\n**Perfect For**\n- Beginners learning boxing basics\n- Fitness enthusiasts wanting a fun workout\n- Experienced boxers staying sharp\n\nNo experience needed. Just clear some space, put on your Quest, and start throwing punches.\n\n**Help Shape the Future (Open Source)**\n\nJoin Discord at https://discord.gg/ATGvjfDJ", "short_description": "Train like a boxer in VR. Follow realistic pad drills with jabs, crosses, hooks, and uppercuts. Practice defense with duck-and-weave combos. Track your power, speed, and form after every session."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://wobble-bot-games.gitlab.io/boxing-drills/privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://wobble-bot-games.gitlab.io/boxing-drill/terms.html", "publisher_name": "Wobble Bot Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://wobble-bot-games.gitlab.io/boxing-drills/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "conte